Entrance Locked [fluid objects]
To close the entrance of the fluid object, select this check box. If you lock the entrance of the fluid object,
no material can flow into the object.
Remarks
Plant Simulation shows the State Graphic [defined] of a fluid object, whose entrance is locked, as a
cyan-colored ring on a pole by default.
SimTalk
EntranceLocked [SimTalk] - fluid objects
Entrance Locked [fluid objects]
Plant Simulation Help 11-2653
Unpublished work. © 2026 Siemens

Exit Locked [fluid objects]
To close the exit of the fluid object, select this check box. If you close the exit of a fluid object, Plant
Simulation prevents material from flowing off.
